# Assets

## entry.js

```js
// lib/forward.js
if (globalThis.showForwarder) console.log("forward");
// entry.js
console.log("entry", 1);
let signal = "ready";
if (globalThis.load) import("./other.js");
export { signal };

```

## other.js

